{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちはー!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/6475634/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のウィッグand前田クラッカーが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思いの外好評で満足してます、桜井です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/6475634/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「当たり前田のクラッカー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"激古なギャグみたいだけど、\n一時期学校とかで流行ったよね??\n私友だちと話してる時\n連発してた記憶が......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/6475634/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/6475634/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マシューも懐かしいですよね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、ちっちゃい頃マシュー大好きだったから\n思い出したとき、無性にテンション上がりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/6475634/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いたいですねー♪\n私のこと「チェリー」とかって\n呼んでくれるんですかね??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いーなぁぁぁぁぁあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、因みに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもレコーディングを担当してくださっているスタッフさんには\n「チェリー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"て呼ばれてます←"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/6475634/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/6475634/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん→「ホワイトストーン」\nまいまい→「ディープリバー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかつき→「ヤングムーン」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構安易に付けられてる(笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど、地味に気に入っているよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/6475634/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/6475634/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ＢＬＴコラボＴシャツ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は白地に黒!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白ならさ、\n女性も男性も着られるし♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白を上に持ってくると\n顔の印象が明るくなるから好きなのです♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パッと見、\n黒のハートが溶けてるし\n書いている言葉にえっ；；って\n思った方もいたかもしれませんが......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「NO DREAM  NO LIFE」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢も希望もない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/6475634/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/6475634/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の様な暗い系の意味ではなくて!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢がなくちゃ、人生終わりだぜっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みたいな；；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"様するに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなに小さくたっていいから\nみんな自分だけの夢を持って生きよう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"て意味でこの言葉にしました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかファンの皆さんが\n「NO DREAM  NO LIFE」着て\n握手会来てくれる日を\n楽しみにしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/6475634/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージからこのＴシャツ見えたら笑ってしまいそうだ........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、見つけたよぉぉぉお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てパフォーマンス中に叫んでしまいそうだ......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみだなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/6475634/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/6475634/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/6475634/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/6475634/0012.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}